# Everything in this directory is FETCHED, not authored:
#
#   mix bl.embed.fetch --bundle
#
# and `mix bl.build` runs exactly that before it packs, so a released `bl` ships
# these weights inside its payload (`BeamLisp.Model.bundled_root/0`). They must
# never be committed: 32 MB of third-party binaries in the history, per branch.
#
# The rule lives HERE, next to the data, so it holds whatever the root
# .gitignore says, and so anyone who copies or renames this directory carries
# the protection with it. The root file points at this one instead of repeating
# the pattern (two rules for one fact is how one of them goes stale).
*
!.gitignore
